# ===== HISTOIRE 23 — HYPERPOP (~2018, 100 gecs / PC Music) =====
# Supersaw saturée, voix pitchée, bitcrush à fond, joie criarde et bubblegum.
# La pop poussée dans le rouge, assumée et maximaliste.
title:  Hyperpop
bpm:    160
key:    e major
duck:   30
scene:  kaleido
song:   a*8 b*8
kick:  x . . . x . . . x . . . x . . . | sample bd | gain 0.5
clap:  . . . . x . . . . . . . x . . . | sample cp | crush 6 | gain 0.35
supr:  1 . 3 . 5 . 1' . 6 . 5 . 3 . 2 . | saw | supersaw | crush 5 | lp 3000 | drive 0.4 | gain 0.1
bass:  1 . 1 . 6, . 6, . 4, . 4, . 5, . 5, . | square | oct 2 | drive 0.4 | gain 0.14
vox@b: 1' 1' . 7 . 5 . . 3' . . 5 . . 1' . | sine | double 0.5 | crush 4 | delay 0.2 | reverb 0.3 | gain 0.1
